OL,3,GNEWSABrighton Anthropic founder to
OL,4,Abecome billionaire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Brighton who helped to set
OL,7,Fup the AI company Anthropic, which made
OL,8,Fits stock market debut on Thursday, is
OL,9,Fset to become a billionaire.
OL,11,FJack Clark was caught up in the
OL,12,Fexcitement of artificial intelligence
OL,13,Fand joined OpenAI, where he initially
OL,14,Fworked in communications, later
OL,15,Fbecoming its policy director.
OL,17,FThe company behind Anthropic, Claude,
OL,18,Fwas formed by seven people who left
OL,19,Frival OpenAI in 2021 and will become
OL,20,Fmulti-billionaires - on paper at least.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
